[
  {
    "id": 0,
    "localized_name": "（システム）",
    "romanized_name": "",
    "model_path_hash": 0,
    "text": "翌日――",
    "voice_file": "",
    "still_path_hash": 0,
    "speech_balloon_type_id": 965274698
  },
  {
    "id": 1,
    "localized_name": "ヤンネ",
    "romanized_name": "Janne",
    "model_path_hash": 2318022885960174855,
    "text": "――はい！　今日の鍛錬はここまでにしましょう。\nみんな、お疲れさま。いい汗かいたわね！",
    "voice_file": "",
    "still_path_hash": 3552163027021623318,
    "speech_balloon_type_id": 780292254
  },
  {
    "id": 2,
    "localized_name": "アルビーナ",
    "romanized_name": "Alvina",
    "model_path_hash": 8589968507503775476,
    "text": "はぁっ、はぁ……疲れた……\nヤンネさんはまだまだ元気そうだね……",
    "voice_file": "",
    "still_path_hash": 8874763601186801212,
    "speech_balloon_type_id": 780292254
  },
  {
    "id": 3,
    "localized_name": "ヤンネ",
    "romanized_name": "Janne",
    "model_path_hash": 2318022885960174855,
    "text": "ええ。今日はいつも以上にやる気あるわよ。\nあなたたちが用意してくれたごちそうのおかげかしら",
    "voice_file": "",
    "still_path_hash": 3552163027021623318,
    "speech_balloon_type_id": 780292254
  },
  {
    "id": 4,
    "localized_name": "ベップ",
    "romanized_name": "Bepp",
    "model_path_hash": 2719129412126717307,
    "text": "ごちそうで鍛錬から気を逸らさせる作戦は失敗ね……\nむしろ、昨日よりキツい内容になってた気が",
    "voice_file": "",
    "still_path_hash": 4522117749578412567,
    "speech_balloon_type_id": 780292254
  },
  {
    "id": 5,
    "localized_name": "アルビーナ",
    "romanized_name": "Alvina",
    "model_path_hash": 8589968507503775476,
    "text": "なのにヤドヴィガはけろっとしてるし、さすが九偉人。\n……というか鍛錬中、一番生き生きしてたような",
    "voice_file": "",
    "still_path_hash": 8874763601186801212,
    "speech_balloon_type_id": 780292254
  },
  {
    "id": 6,
    "localized_name": "ヤドヴィガ",
    "romanized_name": "Jadwiga",
    "model_path_hash": 2111970354351478659,
    "text": "砂浜の性質を活かした良い鍛錬だった。\nこれが、休暇の過ごし方――",
    "voice_file": "",
    "still_path_hash": 6170794110252514656,
    "speech_balloon_type_id": 780292254
  },
  {
    "id": 7,
    "localized_name": "ヤドヴィガ",
    "romanized_name": "Jadwiga",
    "model_path_hash": 2111970354351478659,
    "text": "さらに休暇を遂行する。\nヤンネ、続きを",
    "voice_file": "",
    "still_path_hash": 6170794110252514656,
    "speech_balloon_type_id": 780292254
  },
  {
    "id": 8,
    "localized_name": "アルビーナ",
    "romanized_name": "Alvina",
    "model_path_hash": 8589968507503775476,
    "text": "ちょっと待てーい！\nなに追加しようとしてるんじゃい！",
    "voice_file": "",
    "still_path_hash": 8874763601186801212,
    "speech_balloon_type_id": 780292254
  },
  {
    "id": 9,
    "localized_name": "ヤンネ",
    "romanized_name": "Janne",
    "model_path_hash": 2318022885960174855,
    "text": "ええ。過度な鍛錬はかえって身体に悪いわ。\n九偉人のあなたなら問題ないのかもしれないけれど",
    "voice_file": "",
    "still_path_hash": 3552163027021623318,
    "speech_balloon_type_id": 780292254
  },
  {
    "id": 10,
    "localized_name": "アルビーナ",
    "romanized_name": "Alvina",
    "model_path_hash": 8589968507503775476,
    "text": "そうだけど、そういうことでもなーい！",
    "voice_file": "",
    "still_path_hash": 8874763601186801212,
    "speech_balloon_type_id": 780292254
  },
  {
    "id": 11,
    "localized_name": "アルビーナ",
    "romanized_name": "Alvina",
    "model_path_hash": 8589968507503775476,
    "text": "いーい、ヤドヴィガ？\n休暇の過ごし方っていうのは、もっと違うの！",
    "voice_file": "",
    "still_path_hash": 8874763601186801212,
    "speech_balloon_type_id": 780292254
  },
  {
    "id": 12,
    "localized_name": "アルビーナ",
    "romanized_name": "Alvina",
    "model_path_hash": 8589968507503775476,
    "text": "まぁ、世界には休暇中も鍛錬をして過ごす人も\nいるかもしれないけど、基本的には違うの！",
    "voice_file": "",
    "still_path_hash": 8874763601186801212,
    "speech_balloon_type_id": 780292254
  },
  {
    "id": 13,
    "localized_name": "ヤドヴィガ",
    "romanized_name": "Jadwiga",
    "model_path_hash": 2111970354351478659,
    "text": "では、休暇中は何を？",
    "voice_file": "",
    "still_path_hash": 6170794110252514656,
    "speech_balloon_type_id": 780292254
  },
  {
    "id": 14,
    "localized_name": "ベップ",
    "romanized_name": "Bepp",
    "model_path_hash": 2719129412126717307,
    "text": "ここみたいな行楽地に行って、綺麗な海で遊んだり、\nゆったりくつろいだり、美味しいものを食べたり……",
    "voice_file": "",
    "still_path_hash": 4522117749578412567,
    "speech_balloon_type_id": 780292254
  },
  {
    "id": 15,
    "localized_name": "ベップ",
    "romanized_name": "Bepp",
    "model_path_hash": 2719129412126717307,
    "text": "そして、姉様がそんな休暇を満喫できるよう動くのが\n私の休暇の使命",
    "voice_file": "",
    "still_path_hash": 4522117749578412567,
    "speech_balloon_type_id": 780292254
  },
  {
    "id": 16,
    "localized_name": "アルビーナ",
    "romanized_name": "Alvina",
    "model_path_hash": 8589968507503775476,
    "text": "ただ今日はもう鍛錬で疲れて、遊ぶ元気はないし……\n今から、これからの作戦を立てるよ！",
    "voice_file": "",
    "still_path_hash": 8874763601186801212,
    "speech_balloon_type_id": 780292254
  },
  {
    "id": 17,
    "localized_name": "アルビーナ",
    "romanized_name": "Alvina",
    "model_path_hash": 8589968507503775476,
    "text": "ヤドヴィガも協力してよね！",
    "voice_file": "",
    "still_path_hash": 8874763601186801212,
    "speech_balloon_type_id": 780292254
  },
  {
    "id": 18,
    "localized_name": "ヤドヴィガ",
    "romanized_name": "Jadwiga",
    "model_path_hash": 2111970354351478659,
    "text": "しょ、承知",
    "voice_file": "",
    "still_path_hash": 6170794110252514656,
    "speech_balloon_type_id": 780292254
  },
  {
    "id": 19,
    "localized_name": "キューン",
    "romanized_name": "Quinn",
    "model_path_hash": 913274709521753211,
    "text": "ふふ、ヤド姉、楽しそうだね",
    "voice_file": "",
    "still_path_hash": 7374237645965483172,
    "speech_balloon_type_id": 780292254
  },
  {
    "id": 20,
    "localized_name": "ヴァレリア",
    "romanized_name": "Valeria",
    "model_path_hash": 7203201562534310700,
    "text": "そうね。キューンも交ざってきてもいいのよ？",
    "voice_file": "",
    "still_path_hash": 491776654605821708,
    "speech_balloon_type_id": 780292254
  },
  {
    "id": 21,
    "localized_name": "キューン",
    "romanized_name": "Quinn",
    "model_path_hash": 913274709521753211,
    "text": "あー、うん。今はいいかな。\n私がいたら、いつものヤド姉になっちゃうと思うもん",
    "voice_file": "",
    "still_path_hash": 7374237645965483172,
    "speech_balloon_type_id": 780292254
  },
  {
    "id": 22,
    "localized_name": "キューン",
    "romanized_name": "Quinn",
    "model_path_hash": 913274709521753211,
    "text": "私たち兄弟以外と関わってるヤド姉がどんな感じか\nちょっと気になるからさ。今はいいの",
    "voice_file": "",
    "still_path_hash": 7374237645965483172,
    "speech_balloon_type_id": 780292254
  },
  {
    "id": 23,
    "localized_name": "ヴァレリア",
    "romanized_name": "Valeria",
    "model_path_hash": 7203201562534310700,
    "text": "そう、分かった",
    "voice_file": "",
    "still_path_hash": 491776654605821708,
    "speech_balloon_type_id": 780292254
  },
  {
    "id": 24,
    "localized_name": "ヴァレリア",
    "romanized_name": "Valeria",
    "model_path_hash": 7203201562534310700,
    "text": "じゃあキューンは、ヴァレリアお姉ちゃんと一緒に、\n美味しいものでも食べに行きましょうか！",
    "voice_file": "",
    "still_path_hash": 491776654605821708,
    "speech_balloon_type_id": 780292254
  },
  {
    "id": 25,
    "localized_name": "キューン",
    "romanized_name": "Quinn",
    "model_path_hash": 913274709521753211,
    "text": "うん！　行く行く！！",
    "voice_file": "",
    "still_path_hash": 7374237645965483172,
    "speech_balloon_type_id": 780292254
  }
]